{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03964","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 刘宪","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主家别墅帝城隈，无劳海上觅蓬莱。\n沓石悬流平地起，危楼曲阁半天开。\n庭莎作荐舞行出，浦树相将歌棹回。\n此日风光与形胜，只言作伴圣词来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}